          }
        }
      ],
      "sentences": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00007",
      "text": "God preserve me from judging rashly, but he came into our room twice,\nand he set out upon his journey long before us.\"",
      "translation": "mais il entra deux fois dans notre chambre, et il\npartit long-temps avant nous.",
      "paragraph_id": "en-p00002",
      "target_paragraph_id": "fr-p00001",
      "languages": {
        "base": "en",
        "learning": "fr"
      },
      "replacements": [],
      "sentences": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00008",
      "text": "\"Alas!\"",
      "translation": "Hélas!",
      "paragraph_id": "en-p00003",
      "target_paragraph_id": "fr-p00001",
      "languages": {
        "base": "en",
        "learning": "fr"
      },
      "replacements": [],
      "sentences": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00009",
      "text": "said Candide, \"dear Pangloss has often demonstrated to me that\nthe goods of this world are common to all men, and that each has an\nequal right to them.",
      "translation": "dit Candide, le bon Pangloss\nm’avait souvent prouvé que les biens de la terre sont communs à tous\nles hommes, que chacun y a un droit égal.",
      "paragraph_id": "en-p00003",
      "target_paragraph_id": "fr-p00001",
      "languages": {
        "base": "en",
        "learning": "fr"
      },
