    {
      "id": "p00015",
      "text": "\"Sell one of the horses,\" replied the old woman. \"I will ride behind\nMiss Cunegonde, though I can hold myself only on one buttock, and we\nshall reach Cadiz.\"",
      "translation": "Vendons un des chevaux, dit\nla vieille; je monterai en croupe derrière mademoiselle, quoique je ne\npuisse me tenir que sur une fesse, et nous arriverons à Cadix.",
      "paragraph_id": "en-p00006",
      "target_paragraph_id": "fr-p00001",
      "languages": {
        "base": "en",
        "learning": "fr"
